Maintainer: Jonghyeon Park <shapelayer.dev@gmail.com>
Description: Provides Korean morphological analysis, part-of-speech (POS)
    tagging, noun extraction, Hangul (Korean script) conversion utilities,
    concordance search, mutual information statistics, and user dictionary
    management tools for Korean text research. The morphological analyzer
    backend is derived from the 'KoNLP' package and the 'HanNanum' analyzer,
    and is reimplemented in native C so that no Java runtime is required.
    Bundled dictionary and statistical resources allow analysis to work
    out of the box, and optional dictionaries can be loaded at runtime from
    the 'Sejong' and 'NIADic' packages when they are installed and loaded.
